<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16998" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτέλ-εια</span></b> , Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτέλεα</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>GDI</u>
			5040.22
		</span></i>, ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incompleteness, imperfection,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				261a36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				758b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				380a31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.13.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>exemption from public burdens</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλη</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἀ. στρατηΐης καὶ φόρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.67
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδοσαν Κροίσῳ . . ἀτελείην καὶ
					προεδρίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.47
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπάντων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἄλλου</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρου</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				1.40
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοικίου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.121
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατείας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				551
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧν ἂν εἰσάγῃ ἢ ἐξάγῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					10.13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν ἀ.</span> to purchase
				<i>immunity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.570
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὸς ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					276.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρέσθαι, ἔχειν,</span> enjoy
				<i>it,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>: generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιούτων πραγματειῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.147
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπικραίνειν</span> confirm
				<i>immunity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				362
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀτελείας</span>”
				<i>without payment, gratis,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					59.39
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philonid.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.46
			</span></i>.</div>
